msgstr "Standardprofilen wedderherstellen"

#: EditPage.cpp:570
msgid ""
"The current profile has not been saved.\n"
"Do you want to save it?"
msgstr ""
"Du hest dat aktuelle Profil nich sekert.\n"
"Wullt Du dat sekern?"

#: EditPage.cpp:571
msgid "Save Profile"
msgstr "Profil sekern"

